  "description": "Kim Gyo-Joo is a cult leader, a scammer, and a man who likes his money easy and his work easier. But one day, a bizarre quest is dropped on him by the heavens: get ravaged by ten of his own believers in three days or die. He has no interest in men, but he has even less interest in dying. Now he’s bargaining, scheming, and gritting his teeth for the most humiliating survival mission of his life.\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)\n\n*Note: Part of RIDI's Sengmotjung Danpyeonseon (섹못죽 단편선) Collection.*",
